            <div xml:id="d338-a1">

                <pb facs="0360" n="244" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg244"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Beaupré</hi>:, Minister Plenipotentiary of the
                    United States to the Republic of Cuba, Habana: Pray tell President Taft to
                    accept our most solemn protest in the name of the Independent Colored Party
                    against outrages against our persons and our rights by armed forces of the Cuban
                    Government. We protest to civilization and ask for guaranties of our lives,
                    families, interests, rights and liberties. Weary of injustice and abuses, we
                    look to the protection of your Government under article three of the Platt
                    Amendment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hipólito Aranguren</hi>
                    </signed> (et al.)</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
